Package: buisc
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libglib2.0-0t64 (>= 2.80), libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.8), libgstreamer1.0-0 (>= 1.20), gstreamer1.0-plugins-base (>= 1.20), gstreamer1.0-plugins-good (>= 1.20), gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad (>= 1.20), gstreamer1.0-libav (>= 1.20), hicolor-icon-theme
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Description: Lightweight native Bilibili audio player for Linux
 Buisc is a GTK4 and GStreamer based desktop music player for
 Bilibili audio.
